  "body": "North facing, sheltered bach with all day sun, and beautiful sea views to Orewa beach and north.\r\n \r\nThe bach is open plan with one double bedroom, one single bedroom, and one bathroom. Decking has views to Orewa beach. Bonus basement garage and laundry.\r\n \r\nOnly minutes walk to the beautiful Red Beach, close to shops and just 30 min north of Auckland CBD.\r\n \r\nChattels include fridge freezer, stove, washing machine and dryer, TV cabinet and bunk beds.\r\n \r\nNote, you are not purchasing land but shares in the Pinewoods Motor Camp, with the right to reside in the bach. For the first 24 months, baches may only be occupied for holiday use, from the start of Labour weekend to the end of Easter weekend, together with all weekends, school holidays and public holidays. Shareholders who have exceeded 24 months may then occupy their baches year-round.\r\n \r\nHere is a link to the Pinewoods site, which has a PDF document \"Life at Pinewoods - A Guide for Residents\" for more information.\r\nhttps://www.pinewoods.co.nz/files/67bb928ad5746bc3958d5ffb?disposition=inline",
